statement:
There exists a radial Schwartz function $f:\mathbb{R}^{24}\to\mathbb{R}$ which satisfies:

1. $f(x)\le 0$ for $\|x\|\ge 2$;
2. $\widehat{f}(x)\ge 0$ for all $x\in\mathbb{R}^{24}$;
3. $f(0)=\widehat{f}(0)=1$.

